        }
      ],
      "message": "wallet: avoid int overflow in listtransactions\n\ncount and skip were parsed as int and checked to be non-negative, but\ncount + skip could still overflow, crashing the node for e.g.\n`listtransactions \"*\" 2147483647 1`.\n\nParse both as uint64_t via self.Arg, which also takes care of the\ndefaults and rejects negative values, and saturate the sum so a huge\nrequest just means \"everything\".",
